			"Message": "docs(Common): Revise README for accessibility and clarity\n\nRewrite the Common crate README to improve readability for newcomers unfamiliar with the project architecture. Replace the dense, formal prose with plain-language explanations, emoji anchors for sibling components, and shorter paragraphs organized around the crate's six key abstractions (service traits, ActionEffect system, DTOs, CommonError, transport layer, telemetry).\n\nUpdate the badge label for the last-commit badge from \"Last-commit\" to \"Update\" for brevity, rename the issues badge label from \"Issues\" to \"Issue\", change the downloads badge label from \"Downloads\" to \"Download\", and fix the downloads URL path to include the \"/total\" suffix so the badge resolves correctly.\n\nThe revised README better serves both new contributors and project maintainers by emphasizing the architectural rationale (why abstractions exist) and the testing benefits of the design.",
			"SHA": "76c9e3fe3642f208bf78fe92bc57d0af91f567a6"
